Ru-World with a map of the Earth.

Settlement of North America, Europe and Asia at once

- The country that successfully launches a CC will win;
- Increased size countries;
- Doubled speed of the world:

World Parameters:
﻿- Production speed - 2x;
- Build content - 2x;
- Speed of construction - 2x;
- Speed of armies - 2x;
- Cost of armies - 2x;
- Content of troops - 4x;
- Effectiveness of Thugs - 2x;
- Effectiveness of Destroyers - 2x;
- Damage from traps before combat - 2x;
- Loadout of armies - 2x;
- Population Growth - 2x;
- Population Consumption Rate - 2x; Population Consumption Rate - 2x;
- Merchant speed - 2x;
- Chance of getting a Great Citizen - 2x;
- Travel time of workers and settlers when sent on missions - 0.5x;
- Number of troops given for completing quests - 0.5x;
- Number of troops from barbarians that appear after completing quests - 0.5x;
- The protection period of the newcomer - 0.5x;

Version 1.4

A new mode in the combat simulator — simulation of a battle by a city (with tactics and waves);
Ground military exercises are removed;
Amount of fortifications on the battlefield can now be taken into account in tactics rules;
Troops of different countries can't join the same military operation anymore;
Troops which are known to less than 50% of country players have 15% military bonus penalty;
Peacekeepers and shy troops do not affect the size of army in a battle queue;
Defensive military operation can now be cancelled by owner of the targeted city;
A city has to exist at least 12 hours or more, to be used by transport ships to debark troops;
Time to embark or disembark on a coast  reduced to 24 hours (48 hours before);
If a military operation has started, it can't be cancelled during a battle by the targeted city.

