Version 1.4.37 is being developed. Expected changes:

— Chances to get a Great Citizen are tweaked;
Chances to get a GC are changed in order to make GCs appear more even.

— The coefficients of scientific distribution are changed;
Changed in order to reduce the amount of scientific cities needed in countries.

— Each city can have 2 Mints (1 before). The cost of a Mint reduced;

— The Colosseum provides 8% bonus of war (9% before);
— War Bonus of Luck provides 8% per level (9% before);
— War Bonus of Great Generals is slightly reduced.
The last expected changes in order to reduce the war bonus.

— Implementation of several measures to prevent unexpected influence on battles.
Details will be announced later.

Implementation date is yet unknown.

