Changes are the following:

The formula for calculating the total military bonus has been changed;
The Order of Knights Templar now increases speed of training knights and landsknechts by 4 times;
Transport ships can only be trained in Dry-dock;
Troops on the battlefield deal damage to ships and planes.

The update will happen soon.

