What's new:

"Resort" area improvement implemented;
Battleships of later ages implemented;
Efficiency of Great Citizens doubled;
"Cutthroats" kill up to 25% of possible population (20% before).
Galley: cost increased by 50 wood;
Junk: cost reduced by 25 food;
Bark: cost reduced by 50 food;
Caravel: cost decreased by 50 food;
Costs of some sciences are changed.

